  "body_html": "<h1>Myerson Monotonicity Characterization</h1>\n<p>For single-parameter mechanisms over real values, DSIC implies monotonicity.\nConversely, a monotone allocation rule paired with the canonical Myerson\npayment rule is DSIC.</p>\n<p>The zero-normalized DSIC payment rule is characterized by the Myerson payment\nformula, yielding existence and uniqueness of the zero-normalized payment rule\nfor monotone allocation rules.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[EconCSLib PR #27, blueprint/src/content.tex, thm:md_myerson_results] EconCSLib pull request #27, https://github.com/gametheoryinlean/EconCSLib/pull/27. Migrated from the PR's old leanblueprint section into mdblueprint staged form.</li>\n</ul>",
